  "changes": [
    "Renamed legacy clawmark-eval directory to adapters/claw_eval; the separate ClawMark integration is tracked in its own manifest.",
    "Replaced private checkout defaults and symlinks with an explicit trusted source checkout; bounded copied services and fixture paths.",
